cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GrepSeek (code, data, or models), please cite the paper."
title: "GrepSeek: Training Search Agents for Direct Corpus Interaction"
abstract: >-
  GrepSeek trains compact open-weight LLMs to perform Direct Corpus Interaction
  (DCI) — answering knowledge-intensive questions by searching a raw text corpus
  with Unix shell commands instead of a pre-computed dense/sparse index — via a
  two-stage pipeline (cold-start SFT from an Answer-Aware Tutor / Answer-Blind
  Planner, then GRPO) plus a semantics-preserving sharded-parallel execution
  engine.
type: software
